deee6f6b40183c6f168a9bb85e071.avif?t=1750942871\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776700/extras/59047a00b08212c53724cb109376e41a.poster.avif?t=1750942871\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776700/extras/59047a00b08212c53724cb109376e41a.webm?t=1750942871\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776700/extras/59047a00b08212c53724cb109376e41a.mp4?t=1750942871\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Create, play and share your own levels with other players in the Steam Workshop. Jump in the level editor and discover the countless possibilities.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1776700/extras/de3912cf3d6115448137cd5a83167415.avif?t=1750942871\" /></div><br>- Classic platforming action with attitude <br>- Over 100 levels created by our cruel level designers<br>- Build your own levels with the comfortable level editor<br>- Share your level creations cross-platform with the world<br>- Discover a potentially endless number of user-generated levels",
